/bin/

# Generated clock-domain Java, one per sysj/*.sysj - edit the .sysj and
# regenerate instead (see CLAUDE.md). Only the top-level src/*.java files are
# generated; src/machines, src/run, src/org, src/digitaltwin are hand-written
# and stay tracked.
/src/*.java
